TEXT 0 560 Left 2 ;Problem 8.4 - vented box, B4 tuning with QL = 5: Vab = 108.8 L, fB = 23.06 Hz, vent d = 7.5 cm, Lp = 17.4 cm.\nMap = Map,total - Ma1p (the vent radiation mass is not counted twice). Ral = QL*wB*Map,total.\nVd3 = vent, Vd4 = diaphragm, Vd5 = total radiated (current in Cab). Impedance: plot 1/I(Vd1) (Veg = 1 V).
